{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_090_1009_p", "source_sha256": "2a7e431e8f30bb759d7cda173949cd7ed98c61a457fa26948dc9e952f11a4140", "ja": "っと……ごめん、先に始めててくれ。\n……もしもし、お世話になっております……！", "zh": "等等……抱歉，你们先开始吧。\n……喂，您好……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
