{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_090_1011_031tom", "source_sha256": "f6e7b4d8a4fb71798b5a42b80896e05bad2f328d25f80517b0239945e2c3794c", "ja": "会場と、画面の向こうの子豚ちゃんたち～。\n聖母のイベントを、楽しんでいますか～？", "zh": "会场里的，还有屏幕另一边的小猪们～  \n大家享受着圣母的活动吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_090_1012_kobutachan", "source_sha256": "3d73ad2e2bcb9f33ead839a50f4518c700477991a8bc4db9684f54f186052d68", "ja": "ウワァァァアアア！！　朋花様、朋花様ーッ！！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊啊！！朋花大人，朋花大人——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_090_1013_032emi", "source_sha256": "880596a97a8cd610413fbc919d40479cde5a52104e4ccc164de1d81683fc57ac", "ja": "Wow！　ものすごい歓声ですね！　配信画面も、\nごヒイキ様方の寸評で埋め尽くされています……！", "zh": "Wow！欢呼声好惊人呢！直播画面也被\n客官们的评语挤得满满当当的……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_090_1014_003mik", "source_sha256": "783c484439d576678bc9c39f428d3d7100f05d3bc9af1ce226e6512f4f328c09", "ja": "「今日もお美しいです」「正座して拝聴いたします」\n「ぶひ、ぶひぶひぶー」？　あはっ、みんなスゴイね！", "zh": "“今天也是如此美丽”“正坐恭听”\n“噗咿、噗咿噗咿噗——”？啊哈，大家都好厉害呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_090_1015_017kth", "source_sha256": "5a9ece716e53dc1d45f928be686034e82321f763f0841f73631264933f609a26", "ja": "美希ちゃん、よく読めるね。\n流れが速すぎて、私、全然追いつけない……！", "zh": "美希，你居然看得懂啊。\n节奏太快了，我完全跟不上……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_090_1016_031tom", "source_sha256": "e89141e26a7e258eababd93fef16c6305f4eaa86ec52e1b3117da5f39b3af853", "ja": "それでは、最初のコーナーに行きましょう～。\n『子豚ちゃんたちの懺悔』の時間です～。", "zh": "那么，接下来进入第一个环节吧～。\n现在是“小猪们的忏悔”时间～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_090_1017_034ayu", "source_sha256": "160f37fae8c78db592c64b6ba7b80eab03d18a3795cb0c9ceac33610d038edea", "ja": "え？　ざ、懺悔！？\nお悩み相談だったはずじゃ……？", "zh": "咦？忏、忏悔！？\n不是应该进行烦恼咨询吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_090_1018_003mik", "source_sha256": "68effa401865b3284306d624673c2ed465abf6fca0c152856314b7359d6ca68f", "ja": "さすが朋花、面白そうなの♪　じゃあ最初のコメント。\n「会場に行けなくて、申し訳ありません！」だって。", "zh": "不愧是朋花，感觉会很有意思♪ 那就先看第一条评论。写的是：“没能去现场，真的很抱歉！”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_090_1019_031tom", "source_sha256": "8e8fb89ba452a168755d6a884e029f4de6f25b0656094ea9ea794483a257ecf0", "ja": "この場にいないことは罪ではありませんよ～？\nでも、もしそれが怠けた結果なのでしたら……。", "zh": "没能来到现场并不是罪过哦～？  \n不过，如果这是偷懒造成的结果……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_090_1020_031tom", "source_sha256": "20c565b1a5f9f1851dce7a29c35093ba0190d8d73a86c82341ef3def517258e4", "ja": "会場でお会いできた時に、た～っぷり、\nお仕置きしてあげますからね～。うふふ♪", "zh": "等在会场见到你的时候，我会好好惩罚你哦～。呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_090_1021_kobutachan", "source_sha256": "3d73ad2e2bcb9f33ead839a50f4518c700477991a8bc4db9684f54f186052d68", "ja": "ウワァァァアアア！！　朋花様、朋花様ーッ！！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊啊！！朋花大人，朋花大人——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_090_1022_017kth", "source_sha256": "4dfaaaffc299b79f27d1c1f6eabff6ed85559cc11e8ab3d77ef68802770db828", "ja": "すごい……お仕置きが、こんなに期待される\nことってあるんだ……！　勉強になるなぁ。", "zh": "好厉害……居然会有惩罚被大家如此期待的情况……！真是长见识了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_090_1023_p", "source_sha256": "d54c8288da12f6a48ea50243af30eb46134b457e05794383eda2f5916ad72702", "ja": "みんな、トークイベントお疲れさま。\nこの後は握手会だけど、大丈夫そうか？", "zh": "大家，聊天活动辛苦了。接下来还有握手会，状态还好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_090_1024_003mik", "source_sha256": "1f511eef516885428c2104d1a38104b3bc984a07721270f014bcd01aa8b50b24", "ja": "ミキは全然ヘーキだよ。\nいざとなったら、握手しながらでも寝られるし。", "zh": "美希完全没问题哦。\n真到了那时候，就算一边握手也能睡着。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_090_1025_034ayu", "source_sha256": "172485752ea654f144490ce6ccb0966fba03d5c83ea9e766d16fd2d2d5483eff", "ja": "こないだマジで寝ながらしてたよね……。\nまあアタシも平気！　体力には自信あるし。", "zh": "前阵子你真的一边睡觉一边握手来着……  \n不过我也没问题！我对自己的体力很有信心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_090_1026_017kth", "source_sha256": "3abf954d464ea26e0694e2d94a8dc81f9f665f8899258d54d6e91bc586e34536", "ja": "私もまだいけますけど……。でも朋花ちゃんは？\n昨日も遅くまでレッスンしてたんだよね？", "zh": "我也还可以……不过朋花呢？你昨天也练习到很晚吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_090_1027_031tom", "source_sha256": "10a07628e4ad2491c59c943afa17c26b81ef603511d28848666aa470f1374b9a", "ja": "ご心配なく～。この程度で疲れているようでは、\n聖母は務まりませんから～。", "zh": "不用担心～。要是这点程度就累了，可当不好圣母呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_090_1028_se", "source_sha256": "b12709ece634544d32af67a926a9d0555729b694be2ce9963a7d8ef771034632", "ja": "プルルルル……", "zh": "嘟噜噜噜噜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_090_1029_p", "source_sha256": "908c7023d06e1c66621f4648f20f56d8157901bec6d6fd14b1e7421052a65d84", "ja": "おっとゴメン、電話だ……。\nもしもし！　はい、お世話になっております……。", "zh": "哎呀，抱歉，是电话……  \n喂！您好，承蒙关照……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_090_1030_003mik", "source_sha256": "0c3f23d2c679e8979208190d2bf6edaf1998ac3fc6918730a795b8eec1c48caa", "ja": "むー。{$P$}、今日はずっと\nバタバタで、全然ミキたちに構ってくれないの。", "zh": "唔——{$P$}今天一直忙个不停，完全都没空理美希她们。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
