{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_090_1034_031tom", "source_sha256": "89bc37c792284072c63fcc3aa2aefeb5e577358bd8beafc34cd0e721b6638f35", "ja": "ええ、そろそろ時間ですね～。\n子豚ちゃんたちの元へ向かいましょう～♪", "zh": "是啊，差不多到时间了呢～  \n我们去小猪们那里吧～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
