{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_090_1038_031tom", "source_sha256": "a7ce62e281d9129354939aaa5be159a3bc57940390243db822bff7903ad02846", "ja": "うふふ、{$P$}さん～？\nいけませんね～、気が抜けているんですか～？", "zh": "呵呵，{$P$}先生～？\n这样可不行呀～，您是松懈下来了吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_090_1039_p", "source_sha256": "52b256f2a13dc871fd1248c5bd90754977ccf79a3356e86d012589a3b1030daf", "ja": "あ、ごめんごめん……ちょっと休憩で。\nもう少ししたら、次の打ち合わせだから。", "zh": "啊，抱歉抱歉……只是稍微休息一下。\n再过一会儿就要进行下一场商谈了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_090_1040_031tom", "source_sha256": "21791dff22143a66fe585310f0f4edd60c5695ce747b2ac96ed708391570fcda", "ja": "そうでしたか～。私ももうすぐレッスンです～。\nお互い、頑張りましょうね～。", "zh": "这样啊～我也马上要去上课了～。\n我们一起加油吧～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_090_1041_p", "source_sha256": "2bb6c224fcd6f900c88f53d8bfc37a4237ac37caa1d66ab607481f57601852b0", "ja": "ああ！　他のみんなも\n頑張ってくれてるし。こっちも負けられないよ。", "zh": "啊！其他大家也都在努力，\n我们这边也不能输啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_090_1042_031tom", "source_sha256": "1ce2f4b94b57000be19b5e122c62eec15537cb3cf53b7c83f1f54676cee8d11a", "ja": "それぞれの現場で、公演の宣伝をしてくれているよう\nですね～。私も……心強いです。", "zh": "大家似乎都在各自的工作现场为公演宣传呢～我也……觉得安心多了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_090_1043_031tom", "source_sha256": "ed9cd53d4f22d99db4525e4f5c127e9c92d1d3ae84fe35f7f08576c3ed4e40b9", "ja": "みなさんの姿勢は、聖母としても、\n学ぶことが多いですね～。", "zh": "大家的这份姿态，就算作为圣母，\n也是受益良多呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_090_1044_p", "source_sha256": "5a1c3f24d4e60e164e9910b4022836675a96dbefd5de80161000020d21ed7e45", "ja": "みんな、それぞれの役割をしっかり果たしてくれてる。\n頼もしくなったと思うよ。", "zh": "大家都在切实做好各自负责的事情，\n我觉得她们越来越可靠了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_090_1045_031tom", "source_sha256": "e8bd913aecf8dd4d1b5a3f1cc931177915bccb566bf493ab204620d5e2999327", "ja": "はい。だからこそ、私も……。\n負けるわけにはいきません。", "zh": "是的。正因如此，我也……  \n绝不能输。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_090_1046_031tom", "source_sha256": "7479aa9923ba6ed194d28e8fdbd702f8d5c9886633f5bad816760c65ae6d9d91", "ja": "聖母として……。\n私も、さらなる高みを目指さなくては……。", "zh": "作为圣母……我也必须向着更高的境界努力才行……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_090_1047_p", "source_sha256": "521cec6ffa0f59b820aa12bd19658d85e191410d6b4cd2989254c21d0d121eaa", "ja": "……うん、いいと思う。\nその調子で、公演までもうひと頑張りだな。", "zh": "……嗯，我觉得挺好的。\n照这个状态，再加把劲坚持到公演吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_090_1048_031tom", "source_sha256": "3852f2e635a21f14450e870c55e9c74663a0737ee023a14b986b75b6e27a7300", "ja": "……あら？　すみません、つい話し込んで\nしまいました～。そろそろ時間ではありませんか？", "zh": "……哎呀？不好意思，一不小心就聊得\n太投入了～差不多到时间了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_090_1049_p", "source_sha256": "c583356781ff4b9fccbad0a54d5c0d18a8b5dedff548ea5f9957d4864b0ee218", "ja": "おっと、そうだった。じゃあ行ってくる……\nあ、あれ？　なんか目眩が……う、うぅっ！？", "zh": "哦，对了，原来如此。那我先走了……\n啊，咦？怎么有点头晕……呜、呜呜！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
