{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_090_1060_031tom", "source_sha256": "6b3818793a685eccc4af895b0fb15b11c27eb88efdf3fb7497e3d6e806472908", "ja": "ふぅ……ただの捻挫で済んで、不幸中の幸いですね～。\nしばらくは安静にしないといけませんよ～？", "zh": "呼……只是扭伤，已经是不幸中的万幸了呢～。\n接下来一段时间可得好好静养哦～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_090_1061_p", "source_sha256": "ab0177757b6419e1b8e9fab961b1a43c6496b1d00c04538b402a396662f18bd2", "ja": "ああ……ゴメンな、こんな大事な時に。\n公演までには、なんとか治すから！", "zh": "啊……抱歉，偏偏在这么重要的时候。\n我会想办法在公演前治好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_090_1062_031tom", "source_sha256": "bdbb4c0e28a53b8bcdb43cd2525313321a5b33a174b7b568ce114a91eaf7587f", "ja": "……。転んだ原因は、\n過労からくる立ちくらみ、というお話でしたね～。", "zh": "……你摔倒的原因，是过度疲劳引起的头晕，对吧～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_090_1063_031tom", "source_sha256": "88d756a20e55a7a9df9293dc1df81eda6e8260d3aac08a4da612b4ae670a2f4f", "ja": "もっと、注意しておけば……いえ。\n誰かに相談する、という選択肢はなかったのですか～？", "zh": "要是再多注意一点就好了……不。\n难道您就没有想过，找谁商量一下这个选项吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_090_1064_p", "source_sha256": "5a73e461f828e923e3647590453c613159c6e7666c618c0c7e65134eb531d0af", "ja": "うっ……返す言葉もないな。体調管理も\n仕事のうちって、いつも言っているのに。", "zh": "呃……我无话可说。明明总是说，管理好身体状况也是工作的一部分。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_090_1065_031tom", "source_sha256": "ab29d85826264b3df133027928d2f908aa581e3e575343f97d7e094c712ae011", "ja": "そうではなくて……。ふぅ……。\n仕方ありませんね～、公演は延期しましょう～。", "zh": "不是那样……呼……没办法呢～，演出延期吧～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_090_1066_p", "source_sha256": "72ed5f5586c10c2dd7df6db268e849b3fff4fe5b6953fb17d855ce8f253bf3cf", "ja": "えっ！？　いや、それは……そんな事はできない！\nみんなでここまで準備してきたんだから。", "zh": "诶！？不，那个……那种事做不到！\n毕竟大家一起准备到现在了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_090_1067_031tom", "source_sha256": "09d354645f1cb0c98669a38ebf39cb7ea59509e444214840b714a723dbb05404", "ja": "あら～……？\n私の言うことが、聞けないんですか～？", "zh": "哎呀～……？\n难道你不听我的话吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_090_1068_p", "source_sha256": "f110ae4716f649a3f5f9ba557283fb2fc803a91f54b5eee9c28e74f8d1b5c07e", "ja": "……ゴメン、聞けない。アイドルがやる気なのに、\nプロデューサーが足を引っ張るわけにはいかないよ。", "zh": "……抱歉，我不能听。偶像都这么有干劲了，\n制作人可不能拖后腿啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_090_1069_031tom", "source_sha256": "1bfa12ee7ae5f0857ae2cbb836decba1e73dd4f635836d3d455e500f730526f4", "ja": "身勝手なことを……。\nもしこのまま、どうしてもやりたいと言うなら～……。", "zh": "真是任性呢……。如果你无论如何都坚持要这么做的话～……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_090_1070_031tom", "source_sha256": "bd83bbbdfd70f31994ff6b15177d769bfcf3432b01d6774e188c59d5761f1da5", "ja": "私の従者を……辞めてもらいますよ～？", "zh": "那就请你不要再做我的侍从了哦～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_090_1071_p", "source_sha256": "cddf7f47545658035841a6d157b6238b0c33c51e67ca122fe532ad548cff3d09", "ja": "えっ……！？　それは、つまり……。\nプロデューサーを辞めろ、って意味だよな……。", "zh": "咦……！？也就是说……这是要我辞去制作人的意思吧……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_090_1072_p", "source_sha256": "fa748621b546c21ddd9c57d4acb41e571bb2fcfc5e2433298a48e44be201d804", "ja": "……。それでも、やっぱりダメだ。できない。\nプロデューサーを辞める気はないけど……。", "zh": "……即便如此，果然还是不行。我做不到。\n我没有辞去制作人的打算，但是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_090_1073_p", "source_sha256": "123e65c77bd3ba1738b3782eab097b6f890dd7cbbd2e0bed07bc3d3c3ecf6123", "ja": "ファンが待ってるんだ。それに……。\nなにより、俺が見たいんだよ。朋花のステージを！", "zh": "粉丝们还在等着。而且……最重要的是，我想亲眼看看。朋花的舞台！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_090_1074_031tom", "source_sha256": "cfb258781c90a4a1cfa48c932ca4ace620c93f3d97be8a6a501088346749b897", "ja": "ふふ……本当に、身勝手。\n……わかりました～。それでは……。", "zh": "呵呵……真是任性。\n……我明白了～那么……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_090_1075_031tom", "source_sha256": "89b183f7433f941cadd8d0a1869725d5b2b1df8c5b592fcb65af8cbe72cfb9b1", "ja": "あなたの全てを、私に捧げてください。", "zh": "请将您的一切，都献给我吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_090_1076_p", "source_sha256": "38d6a2625ea3fcce6c4f5352400f47cb6f9daa3a84bb5a33cea121bfe9de6199", "ja": "……えっ？　ええと……どういう意味だ？", "zh": "……哎？呃……这是什么意思？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_090_1077_031tom", "source_sha256": "c7ac7cc5838ee7e88d0427fc4f767a47113120988820eae219136c6c173919a6", "ja": "{$P$}さんの心も体も、\n私のものであると、今ここで、誓ってください～。", "zh": "请您现在就在这里起誓～\n{$P$}先生的身心，都完完全全属于我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_090_1078_031tom", "source_sha256": "5cd0c3bfa16a5236d73b457ad90016fffeb105d16ea3e92c8ed984a82b07a977", "ja": "私の許しなく、二度と無理ができないように。\n誓えますか～？　{$P$}さん。", "zh": "为了让你未经我的允许，再也不能勉强自己。\n你能发誓吗～？{$P$}先生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_090_1079_p", "source_sha256": "a2dcdaa0baaebe090bd54b06ddb43dc4f45f80846f44ef3f3f0e8ad9f354c167", "ja": "朋花……。", "zh": "朋花……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_090_1080_p", "source_sha256": "ee554cd8d7d8b3b85c19d3012e4f4241c20a311e559dee6f369db14479d726b0", "ja": "わかった。それじゃあ、誓ってもいいけど……\n朋花も誓ってくれるか？　一人で全部背負わないって。", "zh": "我明白了。那我可以发誓……但是……\n朋花，你也愿意发誓吗？发誓不再独自承担一切。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_090_1081_031tom", "source_sha256": "fd4e12d8d3f00d043f5de17fd7fef2d1adb801ebf9491c7e9fbed87b25e3ee67", "ja": "……？　私に……？\n聖母に誓いを求めるんですか？", "zh": "……？　要我……？\n您是在要求圣母立下誓言吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_090_1082_p", "source_sha256": "3ae8096e56e5caa3ddc093c6606a475cde91825cb88abc63400ced767201bbb3", "ja": "もちろん。プロデューサーとして……いや。\n単にひとりの人間としての話かな。", "zh": "当然。作为制作人……不。\n应该说，仅仅是作为一个普通人吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_090_1083_p", "source_sha256": "813786cc04f2caea9ac8e05e47eecf167dee2e3fa6e91faad172ad3262b3a0f7", "ja": "誓いを受ける者の覚悟や責務を、朋花。\n君ひとりに背負わせるなんてできない……したくない。", "zh": "接受誓言之人的觉悟与责任，我不能……也不想让朋花你一个人承担。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_090_1084_031tom", "source_sha256": "8525544f1f69e6d5e8741e3b8ab07d79a82eafb2e3cb61e80af92f0e93be915d", "ja": "……。それは……。", "zh": "……那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_090_1085_p", "source_sha256": "7e3cec511177db349474bec3dccc3373436c347104b92341338335f09f2f9bf6", "ja": "きっと、みんなも同じなんだ。朋花の重荷を、\n少しでも分けて貰うために、頑張るんだと思うよ。", "zh": "我想，大家一定也都一样。为了多少替朋花分担一些重担而努力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_090_1086_p", "source_sha256": "c75cd4148a4b33ed44e4fe1f9173e992e3e910ced7926111aa7cfc7fc93ab906", "ja": "それも自然なことじゃないかな……って、ケガして\nおいて、偉そうに言える立場じゃないか。はは……。", "zh": "我觉得那也是很自然的事……不过，自己都受伤了，哪有资格摆出一副了不起的样子这么说啊。哈哈……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_090_1087_031tom", "source_sha256": "3e964a1efc542aaa17259122068c196270d11dae6d815917074d1a6272f423d3", "ja": "自覚があるなら、あえてこれ以上は言いませんが……\n{$P$}さんの考えは分かりました。", "zh": "既然你自己有自觉，我就不故意再多说了，不过……我明白了{$P$}先生的想法。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_090_1088_031tom", "source_sha256": "3674eea9a247db5f825fee1d69ef47ddc3ff6f1b308b155bf5b2ec89840f2393", "ja": "では、特別に……誓ってあげます。……ですから、\n{$P$}さんも誓ってくださいね。", "zh": "那么，就特别向您……起誓吧。……所以，{$P$}先生也请起誓哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_090_1089_031tom", "source_sha256": "f65615a27ffec168d2212d1a4ee182f508ddd48da2efd37f441d1168c9340a82", "ja": "これからも、聖母にしっかり尽くすこと……。\n常に側にいて、私を支えること。約束ですよ～？", "zh": "今后也要好好侍奉圣母……  \n始终陪在我身边，支持我。要答应我哦～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_090_1090_p", "source_sha256": "9460bd18afcf723e24aab6b039a890dacae28b56b0d6515844da37be565013c8", "ja": "もちろんだ！　これからも朋花のそばで、\nしっかりサポートを……うっ、いたたっ！", "zh": "当然！以后我也会陪在朋花身边，好好支持……呜，好痛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_090_1091_031tom", "source_sha256": "f288c2b3fc832687a22220cb02bdeeaa5e65b3b44e70e8036c09acb0df665c5c", "ja": "まあ……ふふっ、言ったそばから調子に乗るからです。\n本当に……ダメプロデューサーですね♪", "zh": "哎呀……呵呵，才刚说完就得意忘形了。\n真是的……您可真是个没用的制作人呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_090_1092_003mik", "source_sha256": "cc1be167fc77e4289affb4a708eeda25d81ed87b15db8d12c3b75e3eb0c1dfd4", "ja": "ハ……、{$P$}っ！？\n大丈夫！？　倒れたって……！", "zh": "哈……，{$P$}！？没事吧！？听说你倒下了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_090_1093_032emi", "source_sha256": "5284a86b8e6b15c2ba0192057e0575868f5dc64add242eb5f1272c6c2a797ddb", "ja": "はぁ、はぁ……！\n仕掛け人さまっ、ご無事ですか！？", "zh": "哈啊、哈啊……！\n制作人先生，您没事吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_090_1094_p", "source_sha256": "5dd9d2067f47a7f32a1f1c79214f7d7385493c14187347de382d8633af437052", "ja": "っと……みんなおかえり！　大丈夫だよ、\nちょっと転んだだけだから。それより仕事は？", "zh": "哎……大家回来啦！没事的，只是摔了一跤而已。比起这个，工作怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_090_1095_034ayu", "source_sha256": "4da741ddae0dcac1f19ca3bb97954bdee3037003820a1b45b5e041b056a53652", "ja": "バッチリやってきたって！\nなんだよ、元気そうじゃん。よかった～……。", "zh": "我们已经顺利完成任务啦！\n什么嘛，看起来很精神嘛。太好了～……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_090_1096_017kth", "source_sha256": "f9b68054198f58da2ebcd248f0f2e13e1702dd8c1d70fafba3ad583ca38820cb", "ja": "本当に……朋花ちゃんから連絡をもらって、\n私たち、とっても心配したんですよ。", "zh": "真的……收到朋花的联系后，\n我们一直都非常担心你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_090_1097_p", "source_sha256": "1208d09b58ef1d0d9f6af36b8ebbf282083698c317e6a3652490d89508376788", "ja": "うん、本当にゴメン……。\nっていうかみんな、着替えないで帰ってきたのか？", "zh": "嗯，真的很抱歉……\n话说大家，都没换衣服就赶回来了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_090_1098_032emi", "source_sha256": "7599de52fdbc4bb8d6257e92ff7e724f49fcbd81e9b57466699bd4c4165ad672", "ja": "Wow！？　そ、そう言えば……。\nあまりに急ぎすぎたので、忘れていました……！", "zh": "哇！？经、经您这么一说……\n因为当时实在太着急了，完全给忘了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_090_1099_003mik", "source_sha256": "ef74e70cb4ee0e46f9d8dc4623229e68f040244ebf0cc8080d8d375cedbd5716", "ja": "そうだ！　{$P$}、\nミキが膝枕してあげる！　きっと元気になれるの！", "zh": "对了！{$P$}，让美希给你膝枕吧！这样你一定能打起精神的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_090_1100_p", "source_sha256": "6023e9a27901cf8be82377ca418ebb0cd63a909fd405c98487bb0c568c41a73a", "ja": "ありがとう、気持ちは嬉しいけど……\n捻挫だからな？", "zh": "谢谢你的好意，我很开心，不过……\n我这是扭伤了啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_090_1101_034ayu", "source_sha256": "ccd9ee22ea479f8143d35b596452046db24b48b7eb598951347f954c9798b93c", "ja": "まあとにかくさ、これで公演に集中できるね！\nさっそくレッスンいっとく？", "zh": "不过总之，这样就能专心准备演出了呢！\n要不要这就去练习？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_090_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_090_1102_034ayu", "source_sha256": "5b1634d548773241082f7ea7793768e901a40ef6fc9e78bf6c2e46c96f82feeb", "ja": "{$P$}が安心して休めるように、\nパーフェクトに仕上げてやろうよ！", "zh": "为了让{$P$}能安心休息，咱们把它做到完美吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
